{"server":"tw","storyId":"main_13_level_main_13-19_end","groupId":"main_13","stageId":"main_13-19","title":"殷紅君主","storyCode":"13-21","avgTag":"行動後","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_13-19_end.txt","sourceHash":"b871904f321f7d599d37c1a4e9e086a66ff635725f49153378ebfa2e0314bcc4","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"43_g3_giantmonsterspinetop"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"瞧瞧，瞧瞧你們自己狼狽的樣子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"左支右絀，顧此失彼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哪怕無人回應你們的號哭，也別浪費了這片舞台，別浪費了最後告別的機會。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“我陳述，則為我規定。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“風雨止歇，無權流動。”"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你喝止了奔騰本身？很精彩，血為你駐足。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但——我才是它們的主人。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喪鐘會潰朽，規程將疲敝，不是嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"若你如此不屑於自己身負的高貴血脈，我會將它們抽取而出，送還給你的母親，女妖。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她會為你奏起哀悼的哨音。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米婭！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這就是你的血嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"靠你的法術而熾熱，靠你的天賦而熾熱。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我所見過的熱血——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——都是為了反抗，都是為了活命。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那些人的血，比你熾熱得多。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……阿米婭，退回來！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他避開了要害！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"多麼冷酷啊，魔王。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真是一位寡恩之主。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"血魔大君，鮮血王庭的主人，你的子裔填滿了薩卡茲所在的每一片戰場。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你總向他們宣稱，殺戮和征伐就是血魔古老的傳統。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你將自己的王庭塑造成了如今的樣子。你讓所有人眼中的血魔，都如你自己一般只餘下扭曲的欲望。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我認識的血魔，不止你一人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們不曾與你一樣瘋狂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們只是將自己的渴求隱藏得很好，他們只是被這個失去家園的時代規訓得太深。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"總有人選擇匍匐於侵略者的腳下，我為他們遺憾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，不是的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"血魔大君，你如何詮釋自己王庭所代表的鮮血？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"薩卡茲的苦難何須多言，每一個薩卡茲，哪怕臣服於你們的那些，都不免飽嚐血的滋味。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"被人掀翻在暗巷，被人堵截在密林，有時是咽喉被割斷，有時則是肋骨間被刺入冰冷的匕首。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而他的兄弟姐妹也將因此得以轉醒，得以明白屈服的代價，於是他們反抗，直到自己也身披敵人的血。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"多可悲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"殺死別人，或自己被人殺死，這就是薩卡茲所背負的，血的循環。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“血的循環”，這就是你所定義的，鮮血的意義？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們第一次被血沾濕身體，難道不是……從母體中誕生嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"血是人們維生的根本，血是臍帶連接的傳承，血是探索外界時難免的磕絆，和必將癒合的傷口。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而你卻只將它們視作折磨與死亡的代稱。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的偏執使得你嗜血。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你以你的驕橫與傲慢使他們相信，這才是薩卡茲原本就該行的道，該做的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……我否決你，血魔大君。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我否決你的行動，你的言語，你的王庭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈哈哈哈哈！我聽到了什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你，一個異族，否決我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"區區一頂王冠，讓你膨脹到了什麼地步——“魔王”？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不在乎我是什麼，我被稱為什麼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只知道，我需要做些什麼。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你就是這麼玩弄“魔王”能力的嗎，卡特斯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你打算說些什麼大道理，又要用怎樣膚淺的情感來嘗試動搖我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你大可嘗試。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……我否定你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我否定你，將“魔王”，將薩卡茲，將卡茲戴爾歸結為力量與傳統。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我否定你，把未來寄託給過去，把生命寄託於殺戮。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"特蕾西婭小姐，魔王，議長，巴別塔的領袖，曾給所有人看過一條道路。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也許，那條道路過於理想；也許，她的承諾承載不住薩卡茲延綿千年萬年的仇恨。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但絕不是現在，你的選擇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你想笑我懦弱？指責我不配與你談論薩卡茲？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還是想嘲笑Logos先生此刻依然不打算借用你“喚醒”的血脈？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……哦，“魔王”。偷聽我腦海裡的思維，就是你的能耐了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那你自然知曉我要說些什麼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我們從未說過，薩卡茲應當放棄反抗。我們從未說過，苦難理所應當。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"正相反——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"自煎熬和苦難之中，自仇恨和深淵之中覺醒的反抗者們——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"會比你強大得多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"薩卡茲們所失落的家園，不在你一遍遍回望的、那些萬年前的歷史中。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它不該是一句口號，一個空想，一個象徵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它就在這裡，就在薩卡茲們來的地方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那座名為卡茲戴爾的城市裡，明明就生活著如此之多真實存在的人，而你們卻只將他們葬送在了一個虛無的理念裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你用過去臆想現在，那真正的未來就永遠不可能降生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"停下吧，血魔。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"連特蕾西婭都失敗了，而你？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，特蕾西婭小姐才需要我。博士和凱爾希醫生才需要我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，我才在這裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如死魂靈所說的，如你所說的，如諸多薩卡茲所認為的那般——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"異族的——弱小的——“魔王”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"讓開吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"43_g3_giantmonsterspinetop"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你已經沒辦法戰鬥了，血魔大君。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"戰鬥該結束了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“魔王”，你不為我賜下那虛無的願景嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不想窺知我的所思所想，我的所哀所苦嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你可以告誡我，你可以否定我，萬千薩卡茲都相信，這就是魔王的權力。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你指控我敗壞我的王庭，那你呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“魔王”，薩卡茲以你所指之處為路，以你所行之道為途，我的同胞們追隨著你，期待你善加利用他們的血與肉，他們的生命與靈魂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這種盲目的信仰，可笑至極。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我對魔王的撫慰嗤之以鼻，但我……曾見過。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的兄長，亦曾是魔王。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“魔王”，呵，多麼尊崇的名號，多麼超絕的地位——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他被視為薩卡茲的領袖，我們的道標。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他是天生的拯救者，他是能將我們拉出苦厄的那雙手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可事實又是如何呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"黑色王冠所挑選的，又是怎樣的一群人呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在最開始，魔王確實是偉岸的，炎魔踏上譴罰之路，歌利亞咆哮無畏之災——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可他們卻總被怯懦者背叛，被自私者出賣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是我們的詛咒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“魔王……殺死了魔王。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這頂王冠的更迭，往往伴隨著死亡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"卑劣者總是勝出。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"於是，王冠被愚蠢和短視污染了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"魔王之中，開始出現軟弱之人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們狹隘，他們醉心於玩弄手中的權術——他們變得和神民與先民那些虛偽的領主毫無二致。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"竊取而來的權力使他們再也無法認清自己，我的同胞們信仰的對象，也從無畏的戰士，變成了躲藏在王宮裡的蠹蟲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們甚至忘記了——薩卡茲這個名字背負的恥辱！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而王冠卻還是在做出可笑的選擇，直到我的兄長。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我原以為，他會是我們久盼而來的那位英雄！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而他，居然膽敢向我聲稱，薩卡茲們已經無力繼續承擔戰爭，修復卡茲戴爾需要幾代人……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"連我們腳下這具骸骨都知道，我們該修復的卡茲戴爾絕不該是一座城市。而“魔王”，才應是站在所有人面前的那個人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他這樣的人，身體裡怎麼配容納那一滴提卡茲的血！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你看到了嗎，魔王！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我看到……一場灑滿了鮮血的內亂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"王宮的地毯都被浸透染紅。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我看見，一個……血魔，倒在另一個血魔懷中。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“覆血王子”的傳說。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他卒於一場內亂，而你是他的骨肉手足，你參與了那場叛亂？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……不。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不！當然不！“參與者”？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"僅我一人，即讓王冠碎裂！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我仍記得那個場面，我的手貫穿了他的胸膛。提卡茲澄澈的血在我的指尖飛舞，最終沒入了我的血管。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他扭頭看向我，扯住我的衣服……“魔王”在死前卻對行兇者展現了本該賜予功臣的虛幻願景。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在那幅願景裡，我曾看見……我也曾目睹，“安寧”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"正如你所說，卡特斯，鮮血不只等同於死亡。我站在山谷之間，看著一個平靜的村莊，醫生一邊談笑，一邊為傷者縫合傷口。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"受傷的人告訴醫生，最近的獵物格外兇猛，但他最終還是贏下了那場搏鬥。院子裡，掛著新鮮收獲的獸肉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……而那醫生就是我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可這讓我更加怒不可遏。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"多麼悲哀，多麼虛無，多麼可恥！我的兄長，居然以為，這種虛假的“安寧”就能矇蔽我？他大錯特錯！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他以為我被仇恨沖昏了腦袋？不，我知曉什麼是平靜，正因為這樣，我才更加躁動！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們渴望看到，真正強大的提卡茲！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我將兄長的血納入己軀，我眼看著黑色的王冠在我眼前消逝——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可你並未榮登“魔王”之位。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……我並不可惜。倘若它能選中強大的領袖，我反而由衷慶幸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可這頂王冠卻一次又一次讓我失望。更加失望。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我兄長的繼任者是一個，流浪漢。再之後，是個樵夫。要不是赦罪師帶回的卷宗，這些人，根本不配被銘記。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"之後再一位入主卡茲戴爾的魔王，被那隻名為凱爾希的怪物殺死，倒在聯軍之前。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"隨後，是特蕾西婭和特雷西斯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們令人高看一眼，卻又讓人心生焦躁，只耽於空想的特蕾西婭白白浪費了她的強大，像極了我那……軟弱的兄長。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而她的繼任者……居然已淪落到是一隻異族的卡特斯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"既然如此，既然王冠的選擇總是如此荒誕，它的存在卻又總是給我的同胞們帶去可恥的希望——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼，我就在文明之外葬送它。我就讓它真的徹底遺落於歷史之中。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你還在掙扎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米婭，別給他機會。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你也衰弱了。也是。王冠再怎麼蒙受玷污，其重量也不是你這樣一個嬰孩般的卡特斯所能承受的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看來那些等著擺弄王冠的赦罪師們又要對我絮叨些廢話了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……重新看看這裡吧，卡特斯。你若是死了，便不會再有任何“繼任者”了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還是說，你能把你的王冠給月亮戴上嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼……？他怎麼可能還能戰鬥？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"魔王的術法已經深入他的身軀之內，他的軀體本應已無法再生才對！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他在用血填補缺失的肉身，用血縫合傷痕。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他已是懸絲傀儡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你在越發熟練地運用魔王的力量，卡特斯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，你的一切勸誡、警告、審判、宣言，都是笑話。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"無知的小兔子，你頭頂的王冠，並不代表任何職責或權能。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“魔王”，呵。我嘲弄魔王的愚蠢，不僅僅是在嘲弄你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還有，這頂王冠本身。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當薩卡茲們失去了可供仰賴的魔王，他們也許終會從這個苦等救贖的，卑怯的夢中醒來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我承認你說的，自深淵中覺醒的人將更加強大。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"正因如此，你們無法勝過我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"薩卡茲已經墮落的意志，怎麼能抵擋曾承載提卡茲鮮血的我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"骯髒無法污衊純潔，惡濁無法染指澄澈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"提卡茲既是你們的來路，你們就只能在這條延長線上前進！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們才是反抗者！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“我劃定，即為我糾正。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“血與火將熄滅，正視滅亡。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Logos先生，小心！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他的血，對我，產生了影響。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"比那些法陣強大數倍——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，多虧了你們，我也在這裡流淌下了我的血。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也正因為如此——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡也被納入了卡茲戴爾之中。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"誰能想到，當所有人都認為這片大地的全貌已經展露殆盡……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"家園的邊界卻仍在拓展。哪怕此時此地。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"薩卡茲，我自稱薩卡茲的同胞啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"跟上血液的行軍，跟上永不會背叛你們的，血脈中的饋贈！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我會將你們帶去，這一切的起點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那裡會是——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_4087_ines_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，薩卡茲的饋贈，與我無關。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小兔子！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你*薩卡茲粗口*又不是薩卡茲，動起來！削弱他的束縛！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我在做！他的法術比想像中——更瘋狂！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我幾乎聽不見他的心聲了，那裡……那裡只有一片腥紅……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我就要……抓住了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"又一個異族……這倒是出乎意料。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你鮮血的氣息，你是卡普里尼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"無趣的偽裝……就讓你的血絞死你自己吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_4087_ines_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……呃！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們覺得憑這種粗淺的法術，就能夠殺死一位薩卡茲的王庭之主？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當然不能。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別把屠殺的陳詞濫調稱作“覺醒”，血魔大君。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還在仇恨和毀滅之中兜兜轉轉的你，從來沒有離開過所謂的“深淵”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還沒睡醒的，是你們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——卑劣的叛徒——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"魔王！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就是現在！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"趁他沒有恢復以前，把他從骸骨上擊落！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在我剛即位王庭時，喪鐘已與我的命運相連。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們都不能逃過。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但輓歌哀悼的不會是你的身軀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而是與你我相連的一切。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我——不會——女妖——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米婭，與我合奏。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"去窺探輓歌的弦音。去尋覓女妖的起點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看向我。看向你曾捂耳避諱的哀嚎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們必須將他終結在這裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我會嘗試！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"女妖！聽聽吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你還是——承應了你的血脈，我的賜福——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你還是，沒有打敗你自己！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"多可笑……就連眾魂都在嘲弄我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"女妖之主，還有……“魔王”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……你們把這些無視過去的駁雜者留在身邊，在最後，你們甚至不敢自己動手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊……卑劣者，總是勝出。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這確實是我們的詛咒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"異族的魔王處決了我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"魔王與喪鐘共鳴。但你們卻不知，血色的連繫有多麼堅韌，就妄圖宣判……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呵，你們最後，終於還是用出了血脈之中的力量！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"兩位輓歌歌者同時為我獻上悼亡曲——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們終歸，還是敵不過構成你們一切的，來自血脈中的本能。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們真的殺死了我嗎？不。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我已經把提卡茲的血還給故鄉……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"去看吧，去倫蒂尼姆看看——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（輕如耳語的薩卡茲語）我在毀滅的帷幕後等著你們。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
